<BaseLayout title="Research"><header class="page-head"><div class="eyebrow">Evidence to Decision</div><h1>Research</h1><p>Selected themes, not a publication inventory.</p></header><section class="section"><div class="prose" style="max-width:730px"><p>My research asks when evidence can credibly support consequential clinical decisions. Themes include adaptive trials and dose optimization, evidence timing and maturity, external and counterfactual evidence, rare disease research, and AI-supported evidence generation.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
